This policy explains what data this site collects, why, and how it is handled. It covers three areas: the newsletter, site analytics, and comments.

## Newsletter subscriptions

When you subscribe to the newsletter, the following data is stored:

- **Email address** — used to send you new posts and a one-time confirmation link.
- **Locale preference** (`en` or `uk`) — used to send emails in the correct language.
- **IP address hash** — your IP is passed through a one-way hash (SHA-256) before being stored. The original IP is never saved and cannot be recovered from the hash. The hash is retained solely to detect and limit abuse (e.g. mass sign-ups from a single source).
- **User-agent string** — the browser or client identifier sent automatically by your browser. Stored for the same abuse-detection purpose.
- **Subscription status and timestamps** — whether your subscription is pending, confirmed, or cancelled, and when those events occurred.

No newsletter data is sold or shared with third parties. Email is sent through a transactional mail provider; that provider receives your email address in order to deliver messages.

## Unsubscribing

Every newsletter email contains an unsubscribe link. Clicking it immediately marks your subscription as cancelled and stops all future emails. You can also send a deletion request to [hello@serhiichernenko.com](mailto:hello@serhiichernenko.com) and your record will be removed from the database.

## Data deletion requests

To request deletion of any data associated with your email address, contact [hello@serhiichernenko.com](mailto:hello@serhiichernenko.com). Requests are handled manually and fulfilled within a reasonable time.

## Analytics

This site uses [Cloudflare Web Analytics](https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/). It is cookieless and does not track individuals across sites or sessions. No personal data is collected or stored by the analytics system. Cloudflare receives aggregated, anonymous page-view metrics only.

In addition, aggregate server-side product metrics are recorded for newsletter events (subscription pending, confirmed, and unsubscribe) using Cloudflare Analytics Engine. Only the following non-identifying dimensions are recorded: event type, user language (`en` or `uk`), and referral source label. Email addresses, IP addresses, tokens, browser information, and any other personal data are **never** recorded in these metrics. Data is retained for approximately 3 months.

## Comments (Giscus / GitHub)

Post comments are powered by [Giscus](https://giscus.app), which stores discussions in a GitHub repository using the GitHub Discussions API. Commenting requires a GitHub account. GitHub's own privacy policy governs any data collected through that interaction — see [GitHub's Privacy Statement](https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement).

## Cookies and tracking

This site does not use advertising cookies or cross-site trackers. No third-party advertising networks are present. The only cookies that may be set are functional ones required for the site to operate (e.g. theme preference stored in `localStorage`, not a cookie).

## Contact

Questions about this policy: [hello@serhiichernenko.com](mailto:hello@serhiichernenko.com).
